					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1154e74 e-grid e-con-full e-con e-child" data-id="1154e74" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-565be6f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="565be6f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9418062 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9418062" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Bathroom Renovations Christchurch</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f3bf48c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f3bf48c" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p class="isSelectedEnd">Practical, well-planned bathroom renovations by an experienced Christchurch team.</p><p class="isSelectedEnd">Butterfield Bathroom Renovations is a family-run Christchurch business specialising in bathroom renovations, shower replacements, shower repairs, laundry renovations and kitchen renovations. We help homeowners understand their options, plan the work properly and get the renovation built to a high standard.</p><p>Start with our Bathroom Calculator to get an early guide, then our team can help shape that into a practical proposal based on your room size, scope and finish level.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d6fb6a1 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="d6fb6a1" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ce32086 elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="ce32086" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="#contact">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Get your FREE Consultation</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-228555f elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="228555f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/bathroom-renovation/calculator/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Start with the Bathroom Calculator</span>
					</span>
					</a>
