				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d732fef elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="d732fef" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Our bathrooms are tailored to fit <em>your </em>taste and <em>your</em> budget
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-e42c775 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="e42c775" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Butterfield Bathroom Renovations offer a comprehensive bathroom renovation service from design and styling right through the installation process to follow up care. We carry out all project management and the major renovation tasks with our own personnel so you can be assured that we are always in control.</p>								</div>
				</div>
