		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-01afc03 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="01afc03" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-80a7428 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="80a7428" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Don't know where to start?<br>
Try our <a href="/bathroom-renovation/calculator">Bathroom Calculator</a>
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a55f9b3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="a55f9b3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									A great place to start your bathroom renovation is our online calculator. Put in your project details, including the number and type of fixtures along with your desired finishes, to get an overall price estimate. With Butterfield Bathroom Renovations, planning your beautiful new bathroom has never been easier.

								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-88d7a8b elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="88d7a8b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="/bathroom-renovation/calculator/">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Try out the Bathroom Calculator</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-d2aa8d3 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="d2aa8d3" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2084ff2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2084ff2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2f42203 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2f42203" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Over 45 Years working in Christchurch
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4e0b028 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4e0b028" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Butterfield Bathroom Renovations offer a complete Christchurch bathroom renovation service, from initial consultation and design through to the installation process, and a comprehensive follow up. We are responsible for the project management and full renovation, so you can be assured that we are always in control.</p><p>As a specialist bathroom renovation company, we are highly experienced in all matters related to bathrooms. As a result, we are happy to assist with all your renovation and maintenance requirements, from water damaged rotten floors through to shower and vanity replacement.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-601b220 elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="601b220" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="#">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Learn more about the Butterfield team</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-64af85f e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="64af85f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-db6e36d elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="db6e36d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="690" height="455" src="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Butterfield-Team-Photos-Resized.png" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-1365" alt="" srcset="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Butterfield-Team-Photos-Resized.png 690w, https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Butterfield-Team-Photos-Resized-300x198.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 690px) 100vw, 690px" />															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-56c2e0f e-grid e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="56c2e0f" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" id="process" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-536d710 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="536d710" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-831a6e3 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="831a6e3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How does the bathroom renovation process work?
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c309fe2 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c309fe2" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Butterfield Bathroom Renovations employs a simple four step process.


								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c9a514b elementor-list-item-link-inline elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-icon-list--layout-traditional elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-list" data-id="c9a514b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="icon-list.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<ul class="elementor-icon-list-items">
							<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none"><rect width="120" height="120" fill="url(#pattern0_34_6)"></rect><defs><pattern id="pattern0_34_6" patternContentUnits="objectBoundingBox" width="1" height="1"><use xlink:href="#image0_34_6" transform="scale(0.00416667)"></use></pattern><image id="image0_34_6" width="240" height="240" preserveAspectRatio="none" xlink:href="data:image/png;base64,"></image></defs></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">We handle all repairs that are required</span>
									</li>
								<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none"><rect width="120" height="120" fill="url(#pattern0_34_6)"></rect><defs><pattern id="pattern0_34_6" patternContentUnits="objectBoundingBox" width="1" height="1"><use xlink:href="#image0_34_6" transform="scale(0.00416667)"></use></pattern><image id="image0_34_6" width="240" height="240" preserveAspectRatio="none" xlink:href="data:image/png;base64,"></image></defs></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">We offer a portable bathroom trailer while your bathroom is being renovated</span>
									</li>
								<li class="elementor-icon-list-item">
											<span class="elementor-icon-list-icon">
							<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120" fill="none"><rect width="120" height="120" fill="url(#pattern0_34_6)"></rect><defs><pattern id="pattern0_34_6" patternContentUnits="objectBoundingBox" width="1" height="1"><use xlink:href="#image0_34_6" transform="scale(0.00416667)"></use></pattern><image id="image0_34_6" width="240" height="240" preserveAspectRatio="none" xlink:href="data:image/png;base64,"></image></defs></svg>						</span>
										<span class="elementor-icon-list-text">Our in-house design team will work with you to achieve your vision</span>
									</li>
						</ul>
						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1e4ce6b elementor-mobile-align-justify elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="1e4ce6b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
					<a class="elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm" href="#contact">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
									<span class="elementor-button-text">Get your free consultation</span>
					</span>
					</a>
				</div>
								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1baf043 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="1baf043" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5151dac elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="5151dac" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;expanded&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys">
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-8520" class="e-n-accordion-item" open>
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-8520" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Step 1. Site visit and quotation </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-8520" class="elementor-element elementor-element-674767b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="674767b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7e57199 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7e57199" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									The first step involves <a  href="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/#contact">contacting us.</a> We will then arrange a suitable time to visit to scope your bathroom and provide a quote.								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-8521" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="2" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-8521" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Step 2. Detailed design - Select fixtures and finishes </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-8521" class="elementor-element elementor-element-fb88399 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="fb88399" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-74df5d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="74df5d7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									At the time of quoting, we select the fixtures and fittings that we feel suit your budget and needs, and it’s at this stage they can be finalised and ordered. If you need help choosing, we can arrange for you to go to one of the bathroom showrooms that we work with and meet with one of their consultants to go through the options available.

								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-8522" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="3" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-8522" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Step 3 - Bathroom installation </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-8522" class="elementor-element elementor-element-20c2237 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="20c2237" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8e738b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8e738b5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									This is when things really happen. Our in-house project management and bathroom installation team arrive and start your bathroom renovation. We keep in constant contact with you through the whole process, keeping you fully informed of everything that is happening on site.

								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-8523" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="4" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-8523" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Step 4 - Handover and follow-up </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-8523" class="elementor-element elementor-element-6608a16 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6608a16" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-89d669d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="89d669d" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									The handover is completed once we carry out our final inspection and provide you with the care manual for your bathroom. This does not end our contact with you as we like to keep in touch to make sure you are satisfied with your fully renovated bathroom.

