					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">No one regrets a Butterfield Renovation
</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-dc6eca7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-shortcode" data-id="dc6eca7" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="shortcode.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-shortcode"><link data-noptimize="1" data-no-optimize="1" data-no-minify="1" data-no-defer="1" rel="stylesheet" href="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/trustindex-google-widget.css?1789116845" media="all"><pre class="ti-widget"><div style="opacity: 0;height: 0 !important;overflow: hidden !important" data-css-url="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/trustindex-google-widget.css?1789116845" class=" ti-widget  ti-goog ti-disable-font ti-review-text-mode-readmore ti-text-align-left" data-no-translation="true" data-time-locale="%d %s ago|today|day|days|week|weeks|month|months|year|years" data-plugin-version="14.1.1" data-layout-id="4" data-layout-category="slider" data-set-id="light-background" data-pid="wp-widget" data-language="en" data-close-locale="Close" data-review-target-width="300" data-css-version="2" data-reply-by-locale="Owner&apos;s reply" data-only-rating-locale="This user only left a rating." data-pager-autoplay-timeout="6"> <div class="ti-widget-container ti-col-3"> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Next review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Previous review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container-wrapper">  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1759276800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfyTYE3B9Cp_vnlz5tvpiMg9zwklU_-aH-GS6ZKXZhJwNbxw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfyTYE3B9Cp_vnlz5tvpiMg9zwklU_-aH-GS6ZKXZhJwNbxw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba3-br100 2x" alt="Bev Lamont profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Bev Lamont </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->We recently had Nathan from Butterfield Plumbers assess work that had been carried out on the showers in our new home, and his professionalism, knowledge, and attention to detail were outstanding. He took the time to carefully inspect everything, explain what had (and hadn’t) been done correctly, and outline what needed to be addressed to bring the showers up to standard. Nathan’s advice was clear, practical, and honest, which gave us real confidence in understanding the situation and the best way forward. It’s rare to find a tradesperson who combines true expertise with genuine care for their customers, but Nathan did exactly that. We highly recommend Butterfield Plumbers to anyone looking for trustworthy, skilled, and reliable plumbing services.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1757289600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjg2Om4kOF5Uxs04TvfWpBgj7JF92lGsK7rB3cdDRy-xwAXw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIjg2Om4kOF5Uxs04TvfWpBgj7JF92lGsK7rB3cdDRy-xwAXw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100 2x" alt="Jean Bagrie profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Jean Bagrie </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->After a bad experience somewhere else I called Butterfields and am glad I did. Nathan actually listened to what I wanted from a new shower and got the exact one I was after. Hamish was very accommodating of my quirks and helped to make me feel comfortable with a stranger in my home. He listened to me and explained everything as he went along. A shout out to the plumber as well but I am sorry sir, I never got your name. All in all it restored my faith in humanity, not to mention, I can shower again! Cheers everyone.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1756252800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK6goSmXQnSWY5ixwCJNyOKiz77-V6QS8pTST6Dxs9qugbq_g=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK6goSmXQnSWY5ixwCJNyOKiz77-V6QS8pTST6Dxs9qugbq_g=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="PG profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> PG </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Our bathroom was old and definitely not in a good state. We contacted Butterfield's and from the start had a good experience. We appreciated the flexibility in planning our bathroom and their finding ways to incorporate the different features we wanted. The availability of the bathroom trailer during the renovations was a big bonus and we didn't find such an option in other businesses we originally looked at. The trades people were all great, friendlly, and very considerate. Paul was amazing and we were extremely lucky to have him as our project manager. He listened carefully to what we wanted or were concerned about, kept us fully informed of the renovation progress, and came up with solutions to any difficult to implement features we hoped to get. We very much appreciated his attention to detail and with his determination to make sure our renovation was to a high standard. Overall an excellent experience and we are very happy with our bathroom and toilet, they look amazing and are so much better functionally.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1755820800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfo5M182i_xes_u7AAFAE7ZCEtA2XaEgBFxVzohvKkL75XKA=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfo5M182i_xes_u7AAFAE7ZCEtA2XaEgBFxVzohvKkL75XKA=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Andrew Gardiner profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Andrew Gardiner </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->We first contacted Butterfield Bathrooms when we realised our old shower was no longer fit for purpose.  From the very start, I was impressed by both Brooke and Nathan.  Ultra helpful and easy to work with.  The in-home consult with Nathan was straightforward and he made logical suggestions which we agreed with. The old shower was gone and a new one installed in three days. We decided the bathroom needed painting and a new floor and Nathan offered to help with this, along with new lighting. We now have a deliciously green bathroom which we're extremely happy with. Nathan was fantastic all through the process, knowledgeable, hard-working, funny, friendly and frequently going above and beyond to get the job done.  I can't recommend Butterfield Bathroom Renovations highly enough.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1754956800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUd4aIQ3DnEc0AtPR1jtmTpapCTB_FTTl24WrMyrPjC39fNu0L6KA=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUd4aIQ3DnEc0AtPR1jtmTpapCTB_FTTl24WrMyrPjC39fNu0L6KA=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba2-br100 2x" alt="Paul Chivers profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Paul Chivers </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Great job guys. Bathroom looks mint. Builder Paul gave great communication and really kept an eye on the finer details. Really pleased with my new luxury (hotel like) bathroom.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1754092800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtlyT3KDf7qobMVPFEG2iJ1dXFlGhKcqdZoi7SyuW6gon_TAPI5w=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVtlyT3KDf7qobMVPFEG2iJ1dXFlGhKcqdZoi7SyuW6gon_TAPI5w=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Georgia Sheldon profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Georgia Sheldon </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I worked with Butterfield due to having a leaky shower and needing the liner replaced. Thank you to Nathan for identifying and explaining the issue to me and technician Hamish for completing the replacement, I'm happy to no longer be worrying about leaks.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1752710400" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXgYuFcd4yMxqo9kqLwqmGKTpLkVByfRDv7YM3l3f3ZHydHNN1q=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXgYuFcd4yMxqo9kqLwqmGKTpLkVByfRDv7YM3l3f3ZHydHNN1q=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Amanda Cuthbertson profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Amanda Cuthbertson </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Butterfields Bathroom Renovation's is a great company.  From the design to the build phase - it was a stress free, awesome experience.  My measure of success is not just the end result but how problems are solved along the way - and the build team was great, they worked thru the options, gave me time to think and listened to what I wanted.    The team did a wonderful job, the quality of the work is top notch and my bathroom is amazing!   Thanks to Casey, Paul and the team!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1752105600" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlEF0QZK6z8kqLBM3s2AEv8EMPXRnC2oUgmKlSjS9BdTe_Qw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlEF0QZK6z8kqLBM3s2AEv8EMPXRnC2oUgmKlSjS9BdTe_Qw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Chris Brown profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Chris Brown </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->We had a leaky shower only 12 years old but decided to replace rather than repair.  So glad we did.  Nathan was very helpful providing us an ideal solution and Hamish carried out the instalation so expertly with no fuss.  Noticeably the water pressure is much improved something we had voiced with Nathan.  Great job would certainly use them again.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1751500800" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVY3DvAXRg7ojM0bOZSOntZWWFgNJbfXDAB1Pn9c9Qrycvy9G9j=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVY3DvAXRg7ojM0bOZSOntZWWFgNJbfXDAB1Pn9c9Qrycvy9G9j=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Laura Barthelmeh profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Laura Barthelmeh </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Super happy with the service from Butterfield; Nathan was excellent to deal with from start to finish. I chose Butterfield due to there being a likely leak behind the shower; Butterfield had the in-team expertise to deal with any potential wall/flooring repairs uncovered while removing the existing shower, where other companies didn't (which would have meant coordinating multiple contractors: shower tech, builder, plumber). Would recommend.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  <div data-empty="0" data-time="1750550400" class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-id="cfcd208495d565ef66e7dff9f98764da" data-language=""> <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOOOLPqDz1jgO76pU_ovDv9wSnE4DSJFYwLg5oFT6vTldHDvw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOOOLPqDz1jgO76pU_ovDv9wSnE4DSJFYwLg5oFT6vTldHDvw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Donna Paranihi-Kane profile picture" loading="lazy" /> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Donna Paranihi-Kane </div> <div class="ti-date"></div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="ti-star skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17" loading="lazy" /><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->We first connected with Butterfield Bathrooms over a year ago, hoping to renovate before our mum's health declined.  Life had other plans, but when it came time to prepare for our father's accessibility needs, we knew we had to get the bathroom done fast. My niece dealt with Joel who was happy to retrieve the specs from the original quote to give us a starting point this time round.  As a whanau we all had input, so it was important to work with people who’d listen to our needs but also be honest about what wouldn’t work. After meeting with another member of their team, our minds were set. We were given a start date and assured the build and consent process would take five weeks, with a toilet/shower trailer provided for the duration. Once construction began, it all happened pretty fast, we knew we’d made the right choice. Paul who by the way was just fantastic, handled all communication through my sister, was transparent about decisions and adjustments, and never sugar-coated what couldn’t be done—but always found a way to make things work better. (A wheelchair through a standard doorway? Not happening. But they offered smart alternatives.) Paul kept us informed about which of their team would be on site and what to expect. He was present, hands-on, and led a team who were friendly, respectful, and understanding—especially on tougher days when our dad wasn’t feeling well. They always cleaned up and were considerate of our space. Now, the bathroom is complete, and Dad absolutely loves his open, wall-free shower. Even though there’s a brand-new toilet, he still walks the extra to the one in the laundry—some habits are hard to break! We highly recommend Butterfield Bathrooms thanks to Paul and the team who are just genuinely good people to work with. Thank you all so much for your incredible work.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more"></span> </div> </div>  </div> <div class="ti-controls-line"> <div class="dot"></div> </div> </div>    </div> </div> </pre><script>
