		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-0a7004d e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="0a7004d" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b916e27 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="b916e27" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">FAQs</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9207589 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9207589" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									If you don&#8217;t find what you&#8217;re looking for, <a  href="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/#contact">just reach out</a>, our team are here to help.

								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-156ef51 elementor-widget elementor-widget-n-accordion" data-id="156ef51" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;default_state&quot;:&quot;all_collapsed&quot;,&quot;max_items_expended&quot;:&quot;one&quot;,&quot;n_accordion_animation_duration&quot;:{&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;ms&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:400,&quot;sizes&quot;:[]}}" data-widget_type="nested-accordion.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="e-n-accordion" aria-label="Accordion. Open links with Enter or Space, close with Escape, and navigate with Arrow Keys">
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2240" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="1" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2240" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> What services do you offer for bathroom renovations? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2240" class="elementor-element elementor-element-0a41cc2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="0a41cc2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c4a77fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c4a77fb" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>We offer a full suite of bathroom renovation services tailored to meet every need, including design consultation, demolition, comprehensive plumbing and electrical work, tiling, installation of fixtures and fittings, waterproofing, painting, and decorating.</p><p>Beyond these core services, we specialize in shower repairs and replacements, ensuring your shower area is both functional and stylish. For those looking to enhance the durability and aesthetic of their bathrooms, we also provide expert tiled bathroom refurbishment services.</p><p>Our goal is to deliver a one-stop solution for all your bathroom renovation and repair needs, ensuring quality and satisfaction at every step.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2241" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="2" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2241" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Do you help me with the design of the bathroom? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2241" class="elementor-element elementor-element-b920714 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="b920714" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6d9aaf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6d9aaf8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Yes, we provide comprehensive assistance with the design of your bathroom. Our process starts with a detailed consultation to understand your needs, preferences, and budget. Our experienced designers will guide you through every step, from selecting fixtures and fittings to choosing paint colors and finishes, ensuring the final design aligns perfectly with your vision and lifestyle. We aim to create a functional, stylish bathroom that reflects your personal taste and enhances your home&#8217;s overall appeal.


								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2242" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="3" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2242" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> How long does a typical bathroom renovation take? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2242" class="elementor-element elementor-element-50053bc e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="50053bc" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4926eb3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4926eb3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									The duration of a bathroom renovation can vary depending on the project&#8217;s scope, but on average, it takes from 2 to 6 weeks to complete. This timeline is influenced by factors like the bathroom&#8217;s size and the complexity of the design. We ensure all materials and fixtures are on hand before starting, which helps us maintain a smooth and uninterrupted workflow, sticking closely to the projected timeline.


								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2243" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="4" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2243" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Can you work within my budget? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2243" class="elementor-element elementor-element-6a49cf2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="6a49cf2" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-48a2db8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="48a2db8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									Absolutely! We begin every project with a detailed consultation to understand your vision and budget. Our team then works diligently to design and execute your bathroom renovation within those parameters, offering cost-effective solutions and alternatives to ensure you get the best value without compromising on quality.


								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2244" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="5" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2244" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> Do I need to obtain any council consents for my bathroom renovation? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2244" class="elementor-element elementor-element-cfb741b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="cfb741b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3838899 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3838899" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									For most bathroom renovations, council consents are not required. However, for significant structural changes, the installation of additional plumbing fixtures, or the addition of a new tiled shower, council consents may be necessary under New Zealand building regulations. Our team is well-versed in the local council requirements and can manage the process of obtaining all necessary consents for your project, ensuring compliance and peace of mind.


								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2245" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="6" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2245" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> How do I get started with my bathroom renovation? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2245" class="elementor-element elementor-element-254dfbf e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="254dfbf" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bfedbe6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bfedbe6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>To begin your bathroom renovation journey, <a href="https://www.butterfieldbathrooms.co.nz/#contact">simply reach out to us to schedule a free, no-obligation consultation.</a> This initial meeting is crucial for us to grasp your vision, preferences, and budget. We place significant emphasis on the design and selection process, guiding you through choosing the right fixtures, fittings, and finishes to match your style and functional requirements.</p><p>Our team will assess your space, provide you with a detailed estimate, and outline a project timeline. From design through to completion, we&#8217;re with you every step of the way, ensuring a seamless and satisfying renovation experience.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
						<details id="e-n-accordion-item-2246" class="e-n-accordion-item" >
				<summary class="e-n-accordion-item-title" data-accordion-index="7" tabindex="-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e-n-accordion-item-2246" >
					<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-header'><div class="e-n-accordion-item-title-text"> What makes your company different from other building companies? </div></span>
							<span class='e-n-accordion-item-title-icon'>
			<span class='e-opened' ><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-up"></i></span>
			<span class='e-closed'><i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
		</span>

						</summary>
				<div role="region" aria-labelledby="e-n-accordion-item-2246" class="elementor-element elementor-element-a4af44a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a4af44a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6cfab99 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6cfab99" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Our specialization in bathroom renovations sets us apart from general building companies. Focusing exclusively on bathrooms allows us to offer unparalleled expertise and knowledge in the latest trends, materials, and technologies specific to bathroom design and functionality. This specialization means we&#8217;re not just builders; we&#8217;re experts in creating efficient, beautiful bathrooms tailored to your specific needs.</p><p>From initial design consultation to the selection of materials and the final touches, our dedicated approach ensures a seamless process and a finished product that exceeds expectations. Choosing a specialist bathroom company like ours guarantees that you receive the highest standard of craftsmanship, attention to detail, and personalized service that general builders simply can&#8217;t match.</p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</details>
					</div>
						</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-169946e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="169946e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
